# The menus on a desktop (1280 x 800): profile, settings (palette and captions), help, the practice setup
# with a difficulty, a session left from the pause sheet and resumed from the title's Resume card, the
# decorations drawer in the Interior Designer challenge, and the local leaderboard.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Profile
until 60 sessions played
frames 10
save menus-profile
click =← Back
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Settings
until 60 Color palette
frames 10
save menus-settings
click =Haptics
frames 5
click =Done
frames 10
click =Help
until 60 How to play
frames 10
click =Close
frames 10
click =Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Expected length
frames 10
click =Brisk
frames 10
expect Practice — Brisk
save menus-practice
click =Start
until 300 Objective
frames 30
key Digit2 1
frames 5
key KeyH 1
frames 10
expect Hint:
key KeyU 1
frames 10
expect Undone
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave session
frames 5
click =Leave session
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =← Back
until 60 Resume session
frames 10
save menus-resume
click =Resume session
until 120 Welcome back
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave session
frames 5
click =Leave session
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Challenge
until 60 Expected length
frames 10
click =Interior Designer
frames 10
click =Start
until 300 Objective
frames 30
click =Decorate
until 60 Decorate the room
frames 10
click Toy Blocks
frames 10
expect Placed ✓
click =Done
frames 30
save menus-decorated
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave session
frames 5
click =Leave session
until 60 Choose a mode
